Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.22,0:00:42.81,sign_TimesNewRoman,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\bord0\c&H0B121B&\shad0\3c&HF7C68C&\fad(7908,1)\t(9670,10035,\c&HE8ABCA&\blur4)\pos(933.333,98.857)}Amor {\blur0\alphaFF\t(1,6573,\alpha00)\b0\c&H0B121B&}oculto sobre o céu noturno límpido
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Kawazoi hitoiki de nishi no sora chiru hanabi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Hanarenai you ni te wo tsunaida
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Hirameku yoru no mukou
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Tsutsumu you na samishisa wo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Oshiete kureta no mo kimi datta
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Hamayuu no hanabira hitohira
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Itami made mo todomeru you ni
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Mune ni hasamatta mama
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Owaranai de to tada negatte ita
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Kimi ga boku no ikiru imi datta
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Bokura mienai asu wo miagetaita
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\an8}Aseru natsu no yume wo yakitsukenagara
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.74,0:01:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.46,0:00:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}À beira do rio, num instante, os fogos de artifício se desfazem no céu do oeste,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.21,0:00:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}demos as mãos para que não nos separássemos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.81,0:00:45.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}Além da noite reluzente,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.04,0:00:49.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}uma solidão que parece nos envolver,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:54.47,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}foi você quem também me ensinou a sentir.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:01:01.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}Uma única pétala de lírio-do-mar,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.44,0:01:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}como se quisesse conter até mesmo a dor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.08,0:01:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}guardada bem no fundo do peito,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.58,0:01:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}eu apenas desejava que nada disso terminasse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.20,0:01:24.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}Você era a razão do meu viver.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.84,0:01:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}Olhávamos para cima, contemplando um amanhã invisível,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.37,0:01:40.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\b1\fad(200,100)\fn Garamond\fs60\c&H09BCFF&}enquanto gravávamos na memória este sonho de verão que se esvanece.
